Encoding: UTF-8
Language: fr
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), utils
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/Metagueu/dilatR, https://metagueu.github.io/dilatR/
BugReports: https://github.com/Metagueu/dilatR/issues
